OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBreezy and
OL,6,Fmostly cloudy, with only limited clear
OL,7,Fspells. Largely dry throughout,
OL,8,Falthough the odd spot of light rain
OL,9,Fcannot be ruled out. Remaining mild
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FBright through the morning
OL,13,Fwith widespread sunny spells
OL,14,Fdeveloping, feeling warm in the
OL,15,Fsunshine. Largely dry throughout,
OL,16,Fthrough some showers are possible
OL,17,Falong the coast. Remaining breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
