OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FWindy in
OL,6,Fthe morning, with some showers
OL,7,Fpossible, becoming drier and brighter
OL,8,Fin the afternoon. Dry on Saturday,
OL,9,Fwith lighter winds. Sunny and warm
OL,10,FSunday, with the odd shower possible.
